# shellcheck configuration for the portconf source tree.
# https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/wiki/Directive
#
# CI enforces `shellcheck --severity=error src/portconf` — so warnings
# and below do not block builds.  This file is for the developer
# running `shellcheck src/portconf` locally without the --severity flag
# and wanting a low-noise baseline.

# src/portconf is currently clean at both --severity=error AND
# --severity=warning with no rule disables required.  This file
# remains as a project marker and a place to land future class-
# suppressions if they become warranted.
